ow the first uber was happening in  2001. problem is they just didn't charge  for it  so  they never will charge for it  20 years later their kindness is still  free  ross lord global news gander  newfoundland and labrador  such a quintessential canadian thing to  do in such a deep moment of need  that is global national for this friday  i'm far announcer thank you so much for  spending part of your evening with us  tonight's your canada is also in  newfoundland the gorgeous gross morning  national park robin gill will be with  you on the anchor desk tomorrow until  monday take care of yourselves and each  other  [Music]
 

